---
title: "Startup reply fencing"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: idle
  s1: waiting
  s2: closed
  s3: ready
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: spawn viewer and request readiness
  s1 --> s2: timeout or cancel releases resources
  s1 --> s3: current startup reply arrives
  s3 --> s2: timeout or cancel releases resources
